{"products":[{"id":8721571414241,"title":"Sakal Bakım Seti Tütün ve Vanilyalı","handle":"sakal-bakim-seti-tutun-ve-vanilyali","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eÖZELLİKLER\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eSakal Yağı : Sakal ve cildi derinlemesine nemlendirir, kuruluğu ve kaşıntıyı önler, sakalı yumuşatır ve daha pürüzsüz bir görünüm sağlar. Çabuk emilir ve ciltte yağlı bir his bırakmaz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eSakal Şampuanı: Sakalı ve cildinizi nazikçe temizler, kiri etkili bir şekilde temizler, kullanımı kolay ve hafif köpüren formülü ile sakalınızı temizler.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eSakal Wax: Sakalınıza istediğiniz şekli vermenizi sağlar, uzun ömürlü bir tutuş sağlar. Sakalın doğal görünümünü korur ve aşırı sertlik oluşturmaz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNASIL KULANILIR\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e1. Sakal Şampuanı Kullanımı: Sakalınızı ve yüzünüzü ılık suyla iyice ıslatın, avucunuza biraz sakal şampuanı dökün ve sakalınıza hafifçe masaj yapın.Şampuanı iyice köpürtün ve sakalınızı temizleyin. Kir ve kalıntıları temizleyin Sakalı bol suyla durulayın ve fazla suyu bir havluyla nazikçe kurulayın\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e2.Sakal Yağı Kullanımı: Sakalınızın ve cildinizin tamamen kuru ve temiz olduğundan emin olun.Temmuz. Avucunuzun içine birkaç damla sakal yağı dökün.sakalınıza hafifçe masaj yaparak uygulayın. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e3.Sakal Wax Kullanımı: Sakalınızın temiz ve kuru olduğundan emin olun.Parmaklarınızla biraz sakal waxı alın. Waxı sakalınıza eşit şekilde uygulayın ve istediğiniz şekli verin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKOKU HİKAYESİ\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eBu koku, duyuları harekete geçiren ve ruhu uyandıran tütün, vanilya ve baharatlı notaların uyumlu bir karışımıdır. Baharatlarla ateşlenen ve vanilyalı kremsi bir bazla desteklenen bu parfüm, sizi canlı bir enerjiyle davet eder.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKOKU VE NOTLAR\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eÜST NOTLAR\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eNarenciye Baharatli Mandari̇n, Bergamot, Mandali̇na, Yıldız Anason, Karanfi̇l Tomurcuklari, Tarçın, Muskat, Safran\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eORTA NOTALAR\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-st